/* PEM file in bytes, but we need only key - DER (SPKI), not comments
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
...
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
*/

// needs to Uint8Array → string (PEM) → DER (Uint8Array) → importKey("spki", ...)

/*
